    "name": "National Festival of Popular Arts",
    "id": "marrakech-popular-arts-festival",
    "description": "The oldest festival in Morocco, held in Marrakesh since 1959. Folk troupes from every region of the country, from ahwach to gnaoua to abidat rma, perform in the historic venues of the city, notably the El Badi Palace and Jemaa el-Fna.",
